{"step_index":133,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"CHECKPOINT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-13T19:08:46Z","content":"# Resuming from a compaction\n\nYou are continuing work on the task described above, but you have lost access to the full conversation history, and need to resume work efficiently using the progress summary below:\n\n# User Requests\nThe following were user requests from the truncated conversation in chronological order:\n1. Research: Find websites and platforms where MacBook Pro with Apple Silicon (M-series, NOT Intel) with 32GB RAM can be bought at discounted/cheaper prices in India. Look for:\n\n1. Vijay Sales, Croma, Reliance Digital - any ongoing MacBook Pro deals\n2. Credit card offers/cashback on MacBook Pro purchases in India September 2026\n3. Exchange/trade-in offers that reduce MacBook Pro price significantly\n4. Open-box or display model deals\n5. Apple Premium Partners with better pricing than Apple Store\n6. Any coupon/discount aggregator sites for MacBook deals India\n7. Compare prices across platforms for MacBook Pro M4 Pro 32GB or similar\n\nSearch queries:\n- \"cheapest MacBook Pro 32GB M4 price India September 2026\"\n- \"MacBook Pro deals Vijay Sales Croma India 2026\"\n- \"MacBook Pro M4 Pro discount India best price\"\n- \"open box MacBook Pro India\"\n- \"MacBook Pro exchange offer India 2026\"\n\nReturn findings with source URLs and actual prices in INR where available.\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **Core Request**: Research websites and platforms in India to buy Apple Silicon MacBook Pro (M-series, NOT Intel) with 32GB RAM (or comparable memory configs like 36GB M3 Pro/Max or 24GB/48GB M4/M5 Pro) at discounted/cheaper prices.\n- **Specific Coverage Required**:\n  1. Vijay Sales, Croma, Reliance Digital ongoing deals.\n  2. Credit card offers / instant discounts / cashback (September 2026).\n  3. Exchange/trade-in offers (Cashify, Servify, Apple Trade In, retailer exchange bonuses).\n  4. Open-box and display model deals (Sahivalue, Cashify SuperSale, Amazon Renewed, ControlZ, CeX).\n  5. Apple Premium Partners / APRs (Unicorn, Aptronix, Imagine, Maple, iVenus) vs. Apple Official Store.\n  6. Coupon / discount aggregators (\n<truncated 3654 bytes>\n  - **Exchange bonus**: Vijay Sales and Croma offer ₹5,000 to ₹10,000 additional exchange bonus above Cashify/Servify base trade-in evaluation for old laptops.\n- **Apple Official Store vs. Resellers**:\n  - Apple Store Online: Almost zero direct cash discounts on standard or CTO 32GB/36GB/48GB models except ₹10,000 HDFC/American Express instant cashback + Education Store discount (8-10% off + free AirPods during Back to University promotions).\n  - APRs (Unicorn, Aptronix, Imagine, Vijay Sales, Croma): 5%–10% baseline store discounts + up to ₹15,000–₹20,000 bank card instant discounts + upfront clearance discounts (up to 25%–35% on sealed M1/M2/M3 stock).\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context & Intermediate State\n- Need to check Sahivalue / Cashify / CeX for open-box/pre-owned/refurbished 32GB/36GB M-series models.\n- Need to check DesiDime / PriceBefore for aggregator coupon codes or historical lowest price tracker links.\n- All collected data will be synthesized into a structured markdown report.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. Fetch Sahivalue (`https://www.sahivalue.com/category/macbook-pro` or search) and Cashify Refurbished MacBooks (`https://www.cashify.in/buy-refurbished-laptops/apple`) to extract specific open-box / refurbished pricing for 32GB/36GB models.\n2. Fetch DesiDime / aggregator deals page for MacBooks.\n3. Synthesize the complete 7-section report matching all user questions with exact INR pricing, retailer URLs, card offers, exchange mechanics, open-box sources, APR comparisons, and price comparison table.\n4. **MANDATORY**: Send the final report via `send_message` to `Recipient: \"b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002\"`.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Subagent MUST use `send_message` to communicate results to `parent` (`b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002`). Any text output directly to the window is not seen by the parent caller.\n- Include source URLs and actual INR prices where available.\n- Focus strictly on Apple Silicon (M-series: M1/M2/M3/M4/M5), strictly avoiding Intel Macs.\n</summary>","truncated_fields":["content"]}
